      "source": [
        "# Context manager\n",
        "\n",
        "A context manager implements the context management protocol for use with `with`. For example, `with open(path) as f:` closes the file when the block exits.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-context-manager)"
      ]
    }
